# era-fnb-pos — module map

| Route | API | Role |
|-------|-----|------|
| `/floor` | tickets, lines qty, pay, void, tables, outlets, sold-out | Cashier till — hall chips (`PosHall`, blank hall = main) above the table cards, vertical category rail and dishes in one block, check on the right |
| `/sales` | `GET /api/sales?scope=today\|shift&date=&channel=&method=&shiftId=` | Sales journal (`screen:sales` — cashier and manager, not waiter). “Today” is the business day. Rows show who closed the check and the shift open time. Drawer filter lists that day’s shifts. Cash drawer is one strip per closed shift |
| `/pin` | `POST /api/auth/terminal`, `POST /api/auth/pin` | Tablet pair (owner/manager password, no owner session) then name + PIN |
| `/m/[slug]` | `GET /api/public/menu/[slug]` | Public QR read-only (no guest order). Outlet by `publicSlug` per pool org (orch registry / process org) with the tenant filter on; registry down → 503 |
| `/orders` | tickets, pay, offline replay | Cashier / manager |
| `/kds` | kds fire | `fnb_kitchen_kds` |
| `/admin/access` | `/api/admin/roles`, `…/permissions`, refresh-permissions, `GET /api/internal/v1/workforce/roles` | `admin:access_manage` + `screen:admin.access` — Variant A matrix; role code+name pushed to CP catalog |
| `/admin/menu` | menu CRUD, `/api/menu/[id]/prices`, `/api/menu/export`, `/api/menu/suggest`, `GET /api/admin/finance-products`, `GET /api/admin/hotel-revenue-codes` | `api:menu.manage` for the menu. The revenue list and the outlet revenue code use `api:hotel.revenue_codes`. Charge order: menu category, then outlet |
| `/admin/tables` | tables | `api:tables.manage` / `screen:admin.tables` |
| `/pin` | `POST /api/auth/terminal`, `POST /api/auth/pin` `{ staffId, pin }` | Paired tablet only. Five failures lock that person for 15 minutes. Çıxış and idle of a PIN session return to this name list |

Hotel-only (403 `FNB_HOTEL_MODE_OFF` when `hotelMode=false`, regardless of edition): banquets, in-house, room-charge, defer-to-hub, room-service.

Edition / preset / hotel mode are three fields on `FnbOrgProfile` (`src/lib/fnb-edition.ts`, ADR era-kafe-edition §1a). `GET /api/edition` → `{ edition, hotelMode, enabledPresets, allowedPresets, kitchen, activeModules }`. `/api/auth/me` also returns `edition`, `enabledPresets`, `activeModules`, `hotelMode`.

Sidebar: `useOpsNavProfile` + `visibleOpsNavItems` (`@era/satellite-kit/ui`). Each row carries kit conditions: `permission` (screen grant), `preset` (`cafe` / `restaurant`), `/kds` → `module: fnb_kitchen_kds`, `/admin/buffet` → `module: fnb_buffet_planner`. `/api/auth/me` injects `activeModules` (CP subscription snapshot first, then `fnbOrgProfile`; heal local on drift). Submodule API gate `requireFnbSubmodule` same order. Shell reads only `/api/auth/me` and paints once. No provisional till menu.

Org bind: runtime-config `onSharedOrgSnapshot` → `FnbOrgProfile` + kafe outlet/T-01. Ops tables/menu/tickets default outlet **KAFE** when present (`resolveOpsOutlet`). Public signup: orch S2S `POST /api/internal/v1/kafe/bootstrap-owner` (owner password, not PIN). Quotas: 120 ticket creates/min/org, 600 QR reads/min/IP.

**SaaS:** login JWT `organizationId`; Kafe onboard upserts `SatelliteEndpoint` to pool URL (`ERA_FNB_POS_ORIGIN`). Schema+kit SHARED is in production path; live two-org field UAT remains a Product-Readiness 🟡, not a missing process. Line tables `ticket_lines`, `menu_item_prices`, `daily_menu_entries` carry `"organizationId"` (hotel column name), backfilled from the parent.
| `/orders` | tickets, in-house link, room-charge, pay cash/card, `defer-to-hub`, shift panel (`POST /api/shifts/drop`, Z close with counted cash) | Waiter / manager |
| `/kds` | kds fire | Kitchen |
| `/admin/menu` | `/api/menu`, `/api/menu/categories`, `/api/menu/[id]`, `/api/menu/[id]/prices` | Manager — category rail + one dish table (name, price); search; inactive hidden; PLU/recipe/image inside dish modal |
| `/admin/import` | `/api/import`, `/api/import/[entity]` | Manager — shell item **Cutover import**. EN `#30`/`#31`: category `Revenue Code` (41xx); dish `Finance SKU` + `Recipe SKU` (BOM SoT Finance). Order: product-groups → product-cards → fnb-transactions |
| `/admin/tables` | `/api/halls`, `/api/halls/[id]`, `/api/tables`, `/api/tables/[id]` | Manager — halls on the left, tables of the selected hall on the right. `hallId` null is the main hall. |
| `/admin/daily-menu` | `/api/admin/daily-menu` | Manager |
| `/admin/buffet` | `/api/admin/buffet/plans` (+ `status` filter), `…/plans/[id]`, `…/copy`, `…/copy-lines-from-last`, `…/lines`, `…/materials`, `…/publish-daily-menu`, `/api/admin/buffet/menu-items`, `…/templates` (+ `[id]`, `slots`, `spawn`, `capture-from-plan`), `…/management-meals`, `…/staff-plans` (+ `[id]`, `slots`, `cost-run-export`), `…/cost-run-export` (POS sale+COMP + staff), `…/hybrid-handoff` (Phase A: POS+staff+Forecast → Finance query), `…/covers-rollup`, `…/guest-nights`, `…/forecast-pack` | Manager/Kitchen — module `fnb_buffet_planner`; Plans (+ **covers rollup card**) + Week template + Management + Staff (covers+overlap; no dish-line UI) + Cost run console + **Forecast pack** (guest-nights CRUD, editable SKU/bands). **Open Finance HYBRID** via handoff. Settings: `/admin/settings` + `/api/settings/buffet-cost` (+ `forecastPack`). ADR [fnb-buffet-cost-attribution](../../../docs/adr/fnb-buffet-cost-attribution.md); Waves 1–6 + Phase A–D (`npm run db:seed:buffet-demo`); UAT open/unsigned — not SHOW |
| `/admin/settings` | `GET/PATCH /api/settings/business-day`, `GET/PATCH /api/settings/presets`, `GET/PATCH /api/settings/buffet-cost`, `GET/POST /api/outlets`, `PATCH /api/outlets/[id]` | Café nav «Parametrlər». Outlets table + create (`api:outlets.manage`, optional `copyFromOutletId`). Business day; revenue/warehouse; optional outlet phone/email/address/website (receipt overlay); edition + halls presets; buffet cost attribution defaults + outlet overrides (ADR fnb-buffet-cost-attribution Wave 1). Pay `POST /api/tickets/[id]/pay` returns `printChrome` (CP orgProfile + outlet overlay — CP-ORG-PROFILE-01 Track C) |
| `/admin/audit` | `GET /api/admin/audit?entityType&entityId&action&dateFrom&dateTo&userId&limit` | SatAdmin mutation audit (`screen:admin.settings`). Default `HTTP_MUTATION`; TicketLine / Ticket / Role Layer B. FNB-AUD-01 SCREEN; UAT open — not SHIPPED |

Integration: `GET /api/in-house`, `GET /api/banquets`, `GET /api/billing/context`, PMS room-charge + settlement pending bridge (`POST /api/tickets/[id]/defer-to-hub`, `POST /api/integration/settlement-confirmed`); each dish line sends its finance sku, portion qty, and the outlet finance warehouse. A discount is spread onto the lines; quantity stays when the total is 0. Opening a shift pulls FNB channel prices onto dishes and appends the price journal. Hotel night audit polls `GET /api/internal/v1/shifts/open` with the hotel hub organization. A department shift is reported under that hub org. Room charge sends the menu category revenue code, otherwise the outlet code. Menu file import: wizard `#30`/`#31` or ops `clean-nafta-product-cards.ts` → `split-nafta-menu-import.ts` / `import-menu-cards.ts` (revenue on category; laundry/SPA/souvenirs skipped). CP staff: `POST /api/integration/staff-provision` (`enterRequestTenant`, scrypt User hash, SHA-256 PIN roster). Standalone GL: `SATELLITE_FB_SALE_COMPLETED` on local pay, `SATELLITE_FB_SHIFT_CLOSED` on Z-close. Org bind: `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/organization/bind` (ADR satellite-organization-bind).

**SaaS Wave 3 request tenant:** staff login/SSO JWT `organizationId`; middleware (kit `createSatelliteStaffMiddleware`) `x-era-organization-id`; `getSatelliteSession` (`src/lib/session.ts`): token org, active user or PIN roster row, `requireFnbSatellite(org)`, grants from the role (one call per handler inside `try`; no process bind); ops stamps via `requestOrganizationId()`. Password logout sets `era_fnb_login_choice=password` so a paired tablet redirects to `/login`; `/pin` clears it. Not sellable SHARED pool / no TENANT Scaffold ✅.

## Platform billing status

`GET /api/platform/billing-status` — `app/api/platform/billing-status/route.ts` re-exports `@era/satellite-kit/billing/status-route` (banner in `EraAppRouteShell`). Staff calls the orchestrator denies (SOFT_BLOCK export, HARD_BLOCK write) get 402 from kit `readSatelliteStaffSession`; `handleRouteError` returns `{ error, code, billingStatus }`. ADR `docs/adr/billing-enforcement-satellites.md`.
